{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-011",
    "title": "旧驿道"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_062",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "顾长离辨认出那是顾氏家族的记号，说明有人比他们更早离开山门。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "封山令持续到第七日。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1542,
          "end": 1542
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这七日里，玄霄宗恢复了表面上的秩序。外门弟子照常修炼、吃饭、巡灯，西坡却始终挂着黑色封条。每到夜里，山门九盏灯便有一盏无故摇晃，第二天仍有人把它解释成山风。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1544,
          "end": 1544
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有再去废井。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1546,
          "end": 1546
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把半截灯杆藏在床板下，将没有灯芯的小灯盏包进油布，藏在衣箱夹层。掌心残印时隐时现，除了偶尔带来寒意，并未让他的修为增长。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1548,
          "end": 1548
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "真正变化的是他的记忆。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1550,
          "end": 1550
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他想不起北河城那棵老槐树的树冠，也想不起父亲最后一次出门时穿的是什么颜色的衣服。那些细节并不妨碍生活，却像屋里被搬走的家具，留下一个轮廓分明的空处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1552,
          "end": 1552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第七日清晨，沈砚秋把他叫到登记堂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1554,
          "end": 1554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三盏长明灯中，最左边那盏终于恢复了与另外两盏相同的高度。灯芯却换过，底座也留下新鲜的焊痕。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1556,
          "end": 1556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封山令午时解除。”她说，“你可以留在听雨院，参加下月的外门考核。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1558,
          "end": 1558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也可以离开？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1560,
          "end": 1560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可以。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1562,
          "end": 1562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“离开后还能回来吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1564,
          "end": 1564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若没有新的禁令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1566,
          "end": 1566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把一份薄薄的卷宗推给他。卷宗封皮写着“西坡旧阵”，里面只有四页，前三页记载维修，第四页是一张旧驿道地图。地图上从玄霄宗到山脚画着一条废弃水道，水道尽头标着两个字：无灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1568,
          "end": 1568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你答应给我的旧档？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1570,
          "end": 1570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是。旧档没有这张图。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1572,
          "end": 1572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那它从哪里来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1574,
          "end": 1574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人把它放在我的案头。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1576,
          "end": 1576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“叶观澜？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1578,
          "end": 1578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有承认，也没有否认：“无灯镇不属于玄霄宗辖地。你若去那里，宗门不会保护你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1580,
          "end": 1580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲去过那里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1582,
          "end": 1582
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你只知道他曾经被记录在西坡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1584,
          "end": 1584
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“现在我知道三个人在无灯镇未归。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1586,
          "end": 1586
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她看着他，语气很轻：“知道得越多，能回头的路越少。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1588,
          "end": 1588
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临收起地图：“我想知道剩下两个人是谁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1590,
          "end": 1590
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有阻拦。她从桌下取出一盏普通引路灯，递给他。灯芯完整，灯油清亮，灯罩内壁却刻着一道极浅的缺口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1592,
          "end": 1592
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“带上它。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1594,
          "end": 1594
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗的灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1596,
          "end": 1596
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“路上若有人问，就说是我准许你带走的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1598,
          "end": 1598
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果没人问呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1600,
          "end": 1600
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1602,
          "end": 1602
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把灯收进包中。他正要离开，沈砚秋忽然叫住他：“陆沉舟不是叛徒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1604,
          "end": 1604
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是她第一次替这个名字作出判断。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1606,
          "end": 1606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那他为什么失踪？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1608,
          "end": 1608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为他送的不是灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1610,
          "end": 1610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1612,
          "end": 1612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬头看向三盏长明灯：“一段不能被点亮的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1614,
          "end": 1614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有再解释。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1616,
          "end": 1616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走出登记堂时，顾长离正在台阶下等候。她背着一个旧布包，腰间铜针比平时多了两枚。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1618,
          "end": 1618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你也要下山？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1620,
          "end": 1620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我要去无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1622,
          "end": 1622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为顾氏账本？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1624,
          "end": 1624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为三年前离开的三名账房中，有一个是我叔父。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1626,
          "end": 1626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把一张折好的路引递给他。路引上盖着顾氏旁支的印，日期正是冬至前七日。印章缺口与废井铜环完全一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1628,
          "end": 1628
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你什么时候知道的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1630,
          "end": 1630
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“昨晚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1632,
          "end": 1632
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁告诉你的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1634,
          "end": 1634
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“档房那个老者。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1636,
          "end": 1636
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起那双浑浊却清醒的眼睛。老者说过，档案若少了，就当它从来没有在这里。可他显然记得每一张被拿走的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1638,
          "end": 1638
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "无灯镇到了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1863,
          "end": 1863
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镇口立着一块石碑，碑面写着三条规矩：入夜不点灯，问路不问名，见到引路人，不要跟随。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1865,
          "end": 1865
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将没有灯芯的小灯放在石碑下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1867,
          "end": 1867
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镇中深处，忽然有人敲响了一只空灯罩。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1869,
          "end": 1869
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1871,
          "end": 1871
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第二声紧随其后。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1873,
          "end": 1873
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三声响起时，石碑上的“无”字裂开了一道细缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1875,
          "end": 1875
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镇口没有守卫，只有一名白发老妇坐在石碑旁。她看见陆照临手里的灯，先看灯，再看他的脸，最后把目光移向顾长离腰间的铜针。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1877,
          "end": 1877
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“住店还是找人？”老妇问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1879,
          "end": 1879
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“找人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1881,
          "end": 1881
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇点了点头：“那就先学会不问名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-080",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1883,
          "end": 1883
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "旧驿道的石碑上刻着玄霄宗旧制，碑后却有新鲜的刀痕。顾长离辨认出那是顾氏家族的记号，说明有人比他们更早离开山门。陆照临沿刀痕追到废弃驿站，在灰烬里找到一枚写着父亲姓名的灯牌。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-081",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1885,
          "end": 1885
        }
      }
    ],
